# Git / GitHub

When asked to commit, push, or open a PR for this repo:

- Use **git** and the **GitHub CLI (`gh`)** already on this machine. Do not ask to re-auth, install `gh`, or set up a remote unless a command actually fails.
- Remote is `origin` → `https://github.com/vantechcorner/jk-pb-rs485-monitor.git`. Default branch is `main`.
- Commit only when asked (or when a push clearly requires a new commit). Then `git push -u origin HEAD` (or `gh`) with `all` permissions on Windows.
- Never `git config`, force-push to `main`, or skip hooks unless explicitly requested.
